>Stella Parks</a>
</div> <div class="mntl-author-tooltip__bio">
Stella Parks is a CIA-trained baking nerd and pastry wizard, dubbed one of <a href="https://www.eater.com/2012/2/15/6613367/food-wines-best-new-pastry-chefs-2012-announced" data-component="link" data-source="inlineLink" data-type="externalLink" data-ordinal="1">America&#39;s Best New Pastry Chefs</a> by Food &amp; Wine. She was the pastry editor at Serious Eats from 2016 to 2019.
</div>
</div>
