<div id="mm-video-jwplayer-primary-video__title_1-0" class="comp mm-video-jwplayer-primary-video__title mntl-text-block">How to Make Easy, Shelf-Stable Pancake Mix</div>
<div id="mm-video-jwplayer-primary-video__duration_1-0" class="comp mm-video-jwplayer-primary-video__duration mntl-text-block">7:01</div></div></div>
<div id="article-content_1-0" class="comp article-content mntl-block"><div id="mm-recipes-intro_1-0" class="comp mm-recipes-intro mntl-block"><div id="mm-recipes-intro__jump-to-recipe_1-0" class="comp mm-recipes-intro__jump-to-recipe mm-recipes-jump-to-recipe mntl-block"><button id="mm-recipes-jump-to-recipe__button_1-0" class="comp mm-recipes-jump-to-recipe__button mntl-button text-label-300 button--contained-standard"> Jump to recipe
<svg class="icon icon-arrow-down mntl-button__icon "
>
<use xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" xlink:href="#icon-arrow-down" href="#icon-arrow-down"></use>
</svg>
</button></div>
<div id="mm-recipes-intro__content_1-0" class="comp mm-recipes-intro__content mntl-sc-page mntl-block" data-sc-sticky-offset="150" data-sc-ad-label-height="24" data-sc-ad-track-spacing="100" data-sc-min-track-height="250" data-sc-max-track-height="600" data-sc-breakpoint="50em" data-sc-load-immediate="4" data-sc-content-positions="[1, 1250, 1550, 1950, 2350, 2750, 3150, 3550, 3950]" data-bind-scroll-on-start="true"><div id="mntl-sc-block_1-0" class="comp mntl-sc-block bedrock-sc-block-callout mntl-sc-block-universal-callout theme-generic" data-tracking-id="mntl-sc-block-callout" data-tracking-container="true">
<div class="mntl-sc-block-universal-callout__body"><ul><li>Refined coconut oil is odorless, flavorless, and solid at room temperature, with an extraordinary shelf life that makes it the perfect foundation for a shelf-stable mix.</li><li>Malted milk powder helps the pancakes brown, even without butter.</li><li>Low-density ingredients eliminate the need for physical aeration.</li></ul></div>
</div>
<p id="mntl-sc-block_2-0" class="comp mntl-sc-block mntl-sc-block-html"> Around the world, you can find the most delicate French <a href="https://www.seriouseats.com/basic-crepes-batter-recipe" data-component="link" data-source="inlineLink" data-type="internalLink" data-ordinal="1">crepes</a> to <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=n018nJppYtk" data-component="link" data-source="inlineLink" data-type="externalLink" data-ordinal="2">Japanese soufflé pancakes</a> that are thicker than a biscuit. Even stateside, some prefer their pancakes <a href="https://www.seriouseats.com/light-and-thin-pancakes" data-component="link" data-source="inlineLink" data-type="internalLink" data-ordinal="3">light and thin,</a> while others, the thicker and fluffier, the better.
</p>
<div id="mntl-sc-block_3-0" class="comp mntl-sc-block mntl-sc-block-adslot mntl-block"></div>
<figure id="mntl-sc-block_4-0" class="comp mntl-sc-block bedrock-sc-block-image mntl-sc-block-image mntl-sc-block-image--no-theme no-theme figure-landscape figure-high-res"> <div class="figure-media">
<div class="img-placeholder" style="padding-bottom:75.0%;">
<img
data-src="https://www.seriouseats.com/thmb/_wuCFEf4sj91WwzHD36SXmcCTlI=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/__opt__aboutcom__coeus__resources__content_migration__serious_eats__seriouseats.com__2019__03__20190129-pancakes-vicky-wasik-25-65785016b87544f485cd40ea86f83303.jpg"
width="1500"
