<figcaption id="mntl-figure-caption_2-0" class="comp mntl-figure-caption text-utility-100 figure-article-caption"> <span class="figure-article-caption-owner"><p>Serious Eats / Vicky Wasik</p></span>
</figcaption></figure>
<p id="mntl-sc-block_12-0" class="comp mntl-sc-block mntl-sc-block-html"> Add milk and an egg, and whisk until the batter is smooth, although you&#39;ll notice a few flecks of coconut oil here and there. These won&#39;t be a problem at all; like flakes of butter in a biscuit, they&#39;ll melt out as the pancakes cook, creating little pockets of empty space.
</p>
<div id="mntl-sc-block_13-0" class="comp mntl-sc-block mntl-sc-block-adslot mntl-block"></div>
<figure id="mntl-sc-block_14-0" class="comp mntl-sc-block bedrock-sc-block-image mntl-sc-block-image mntl-sc-block-image--no-theme no-theme figure-landscape figure-high-res"> <div class="figure-media">
