<figcaption id="mntl-figure-caption_4-0" class="comp mntl-figure-caption text-utility-100 figure-article-caption"> <span class="figure-article-caption-owner"><p>Serious Eats / Vicky Wasik</p></span>
</figcaption></figure>
<p id="mntl-sc-block_18-0" class="comp mntl-sc-block mntl-sc-block-html"> The thick batter can be portioned out in whatever size or shape you prefer, but with a 1/3-cup measure or a #12 scoop, it will make about eight large, ultra-thick pancakes.
</p>
<div id="mntl-sc-block_19-0" class="comp mntl-sc-block mntl-sc-block-adslot mntl-block"></div>
<figure id="mntl-sc-block_20-0" class="comp mntl-sc-block bedrock-sc-block-image mntl-sc-block-image mntl-sc-block-image--no-theme no-theme figure-landscape figure-high-res"> <div class="figure-media">
<div class="img-placeholder" style="padding-bottom:75.0%;">
<img
