</figcaption></figure>
<p id="mntl-sc-block_21-0" class="comp mntl-sc-block mntl-sc-block-html"> Alternatively, the thick batter can be portioned out with a disposable pastry bag, a handy way to pipe out fun, kid-friendly shapes, like hearts and stars, or uniform rounds.
</p>
<div id="mntl-sc-block_22-0" class="comp mntl-sc-block mntl-sc-block-adslot mntl-block"></div>
<figure id="mntl-sc-block_23-0" class="comp mntl-sc-block bedrock-sc-block-image mntl-sc-block-image mntl-sc-block-image--no-theme no-theme figure-landscape figure-high-res"> <div class="figure-media">
