</div><div class="loc heading"><h2 id="mm-recipes-structured-ingredients__heading_1-0" class="comp mm-recipes-structured-ingredients__heading mntl-text-block">Ingredients</h2>
</div> <p class="mm-recipes-structured-ingredients__list-heading text-title-200">For the Pancake Mix:</p>
<ul class="mm-recipes-structured-ingredients__list">
<li
class="mm-recipes-structured-ingredients__list-item "
data-nutritionix-id="1381"
>
<p><span data-ingredient-quantity="true">4 1/2</span> <span data-ingredient-unit="true">ounces</span> <span data-ingredient-name="true">all-purpose flour</span>, such as Gold Medal blue label (about <span data-ingredient-quantity="true">1</span> <span data-ingredient-unit="true">cup</span>, spooned; <span data-ingredient-quantity="true">125</span> <span data-ingredient-unit="true">g</span>)</p>
</li>
<li
class="mm-recipes-structured-ingredients__list-item "
data-nutritionix-id="834"
>
<p><span data-ingredient-quantity="true">1/2</span> <span data-ingredient-unit="true">ounce</span> <span data-ingredient-name="true">sugar</span> (about <span data-ingredient-quantity="true">1</span> <span data-ingredient-unit="true">tablespoon</span>; <span data-ingredient-quantity="true">15</span> <span data-ingredient-unit="true">g</span>)</p>
</li>
<li
class="mm-recipes-structured-ingredients__list-item "
data-nutritionix-id="9526"
>
<p><span data-ingredient-quantity="true">1/2</span> <span data-ingredient-unit="true">ounce</span> <span data-ingredient-name="true">malted milk powder</span>, such as Carnation or Hoosier Hill Farms (about <span data-ingredient-quantity="true">2</span> <span data-ingredient-unit="true">tablespoons</span>; <span data-ingredient-quantity="true">15</span> <span data-ingredient-unit="true">g</span>)</p>
</li>
<li
class="mm-recipes-structured-ingredients__list-item "
data-nutritionix-id="395"
>
<p><span data-ingredient-quantity="true">1 1/2</span> <span data-ingredient-unit="true">teaspoons</span> (<span data-ingredient-quantity="true">6.8</span> <span data-ingredient-unit="true">g</span>) <span data-ingredient-name="true">baking powder</span></p>
</li>
<li
class="mm-recipes-structured-ingredients__list-item "
data-nutritionix-id="177"
>
<p><span data-ingredient-quantity="true">1/2</span> <span data-ingredient-unit="true">teaspoon</span> (<span data-ingredient-quantity="true">2</span> <span data-ingredient-unit="true">g</span>) Diamond Crystal <span data-ingredient-name="true">kosher salt</span>; for table salt, use about half as much by volume or the same weight</p>
</li>
<li
class="mm-recipes-structured-ingredients__list-item "
data-nutritionix-id="396"
>
<p><span data-ingredient-quantity="true">1/4</span> <span data-ingredient-unit="true">teaspoon</span> (<span data-ingredient-quantity="true">1.6</span> <span data-ingredient-unit="true">g</span>) <span data-ingredient-name="true">baking soda</span></p>
</li>
<li
class="mm-recipes-structured-ingredients__list-item "
data-nutritionix-id="489"
>
<p><span data-ingredient-quantity="true">2 1/2</span> <span data-ingredient-unit="true">ounces</span> <span data-ingredient-name="true">refined coconut oil</span>, solid and firm, between 68°F and 72°F (about <span data-ingredient-quantity="true">1/3</span> <span data-ingredient-unit="true">cup</span>; <span data-ingredient-quantity="true">70</span> <span data-ingredient-unit="true">g</span>), see note</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p class="mm-recipes-structured-ingredients__list-heading text-title-200">For the Pancakes:</p>
<ul class="mm-recipes-structured-ingredients__list">
<li
class="mm-recipes-structured-ingredients__list-item "
data-nutritionix-id="377"
>
<p><span data-ingredient-quantity="true">4</span> <span data-ingredient-unit="true">ounces</span> <span data-ingredient-name="true">milk</span>, <a href="https://www.seriouseats.com/is-it-okay-to-bake-with-skim-milk" data-component="link" data-source="inlineLink" data-type="internalLink" data-ordinal="1">any percentage will do</a>, or non-dairy alternatives (about <span data-ingredient-quantity="true">1/2</span> <span data-ingredient-unit="true">cup</span>; <span data-ingredient-quantity="true">115</span> <span data-ingredient-unit="true">g</span>)</p>
</li>
<li
class="mm-recipes-structured-ingredients__list-item "
data-nutritionix-id="542"
>
<p><span data-ingredient-quantity="true">1</span> <span data-ingredient-unit="true">large</span> <span data-ingredient-name="true">egg</span>, straight from the fridge (<span data-ingredient-quantity="true">1 3/4</span> <span data-ingredient-unit="true">ounces</span>; <span data-ingredient-quantity="true">50</span> <span data-ingredient-unit="true">g</span>)</p>
</li>
<li
class="mm-recipes-structured-ingredients__list-item "
data-nutritionix-id="861"
>
<p><span data-ingredient-quantity="true">1/4</span> <span data-ingredient-unit="true">ounce</span> <span data-ingredient-name="true">vanilla extract</span> (about <span data-ingredient-quantity="true">1 1/2</span> <span data-ingredient-unit="true">teaspoons</span>; <span data-ingredient-quantity="true">7</span> <span data-ingredient-unit="true">g</span>)</p>
</li>
<li
class="mm-recipes-structured-ingredients__list-item "
data-nutritionix-id="28"
>
<p><span data-ingredient-quantity="true">1</span> <span data-ingredient-unit="true">batch</span> <span data-ingredient-name="true">pancake mix</span>, above (about <span data-ingredient-quantity="true">1 1/2</span> <span data-ingredient-unit="true">cups</span>; <span data-ingredient-quantity="true">8 1/4</span> <span data-ingredient-unit="true">ounces</span>; <span data-ingredient-quantity="true">233</span> <span data-ingredient-unit="true">g</span>)</p>
</li>
</ul>
</div>
<div id="mm-recipes-steps_1-0" class="comp mm-recipes-steps mntl-block"><h2 id="mm-recipes-steps__heading_1-0" class="comp mm-recipes-steps__heading mntl-text-block">Directions</h2>
<div id="mm-recipes-steps__content_1-0" class="comp mm-recipes-steps__content mntl-sc-page mntl-block"><OL id="mntl-sc-block_38-0" class="comp mntl-sc-block mntl-sc-block-startgroup mntl-sc-block-group--OL">
<LI id="mntl-sc-block_39-0" class="comp mntl-sc-block mntl-sc-block-startgroup mntl-sc-block-group--LI">
<p id="mntl-sc-block_40-0" class="comp mntl-sc-block mntl-sc-block-html"> <strong>For the Pancake Mix:</strong> In the bowl of a food processor, combine flour, sugar, malted milk powder, baking powder, salt, and baking soda. Process about 30 seconds to ensure the leavening agents are fully homogenized into flour.
</p>
<figure id="mntl-sc-block_41-0" class="comp mntl-sc-block bedrock-sc-block-image mntl-sc-block-image mntl-sc-block-image--no-theme no-theme figure-landscape figure-high-res"> <div class="figure-media">
<div class="img-placeholder" style="padding-bottom:75.0%;">
<img
