</div> </div>
<figcaption id="mntl-figure-caption_10-0" class="comp mntl-figure-caption text-utility-100 figure-article-caption"> <span class="figure-article-caption-owner"><p>Serious Eats / Vicky Wasik </p></span>
</figcaption></figure>
<div id="mntl-sc-block_52-0" class="comp mntl-sc-block mntl-sc-block-adslot mntl-block"></div>
</LI>
<LI id="mntl-sc-block_54-0" class="comp mntl-sc-block mntl-sc-block-startgroup mntl-sc-block-group--LI">
<p id="mntl-sc-block_55-0" class="comp mntl-sc-block mntl-sc-block-html"> With a large scoop, measuring cup, or piping bag, divide batter in 1/3-cup portions (or as desired), and griddle until golden brown on either side, and cooked through the middle, about 90 seconds per side. Serve immediately, with butter, maple syrup, fresh fruit, whipped cream, or whatever other toppings sound fun.
</p>
<figure id="mntl-sc-block_56-0" class="comp mntl-sc-block bedrock-sc-block-image mntl-sc-block-image mntl-sc-block-image--no-theme no-theme figure-landscape figure-high-res"> <div class="figure-media">
<div class="img-placeholder" style="padding-bottom:75.0%;">
<img
data-src="https://www.seriouseats.com/thmb/csFkifo3TJg4Ryb4NyMdq-qh9eU=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/__opt__aboutcom__coeus__resources__content_migration__serious_eats__seriouseats.com__2019__03__20190129-pancakes-vicky-wasik-27-1d6ec83141264d41a2af7a4b35a0c1d4.jpg"
